    {
      "text": "Planning Commission agenda 2025-08-13 (Resolution 25-012): subdivide a 1.6-acre parcel into five lots of 11,301 to 22,780 sq ft, each with a two-story home of 4,203 to 4,656 sq ft; Lots 1 and 5 add 504 sq ft detached ADUs. Five existing homes on the site are to be removed. Zoned R-1-20,000, General Plan Residential Low Density. Staff recommended removal of 31 protected trees (description says 32). City project page gives home sizes of 4,156 to 4,656 sq ft.",
